---
import SectionContainer from "./SectionContainer.astro"
---

<SectionContainer id="publicacion-academica">
  <div class="p-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-yellow-50 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-200 dark:from-amber-900/20 dark:to-yellow-900/20 dark:border-amber-800 shadow-lg">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-start">
      <!-- Icono libro dorado -->
      <div class="flex-shrink-0">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-20 h-20 bg-amber-100 rounded-full dark:bg-amber-900/30">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold bg-amber-600 text-white rounded-full">
            <span>🏆</span>
            Publicado en Springer Nature
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            IBIMA Conference 2024 • Madrid, España
          </span>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3 leading-tight">
          Review of Artificial Intelligence Models for Constructing a Sales Forecasting Module to Enhance Decision-Making
        </h3>
        
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Contribución a la colección <strong class="text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">"Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning"</strong> 
          publicada por Springer Nature. Investigación sobre modelos de IA para previsión de ventas 
          y mejora en la toma de decisiones empresariales. Peer-reviewed y presentada en la 
          43rd IBIMA Conference en Madrid.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a 
            href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-77493-5_13"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-white border-2 border-amber-600 rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-50 transition-colors dark:text-amber-400 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-amber-500 dark:hover:bg-gray-700"
          >
            Ver Publicación en Springer
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            DOI: 10.1007/978-3-031-77493-5_13
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</SectionContainer>